Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.02,0:01:39.81,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,EPISODE 12: BUNGA YANG TAK TERSENTUH
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.99,0:01:54.68,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,"MIYAKOJIMA"
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.55,0:01:26.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rich Girl Caretaker
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.06,0:01:31.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I'm Secretly the Caregiver of the\NMost Popular Girl in This Rich Kid School
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.02,0:01:39.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa? Dia tak masuk?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.81,0:01:42.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tiga hari jelang turnamen olahraga...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.59,0:01:45.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Narika mendadak absen sekolah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.35,0:01:47.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Demi menjenguknya,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.78,0:01:51.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku minta Shizune mengatur pertemuan\Ndengan Keluarga Miyakojima.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.99,0:01:54.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kukira mereka bakal menolak, tapi ternyata...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.98,0:01:58.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah lama sekali aku tak menginjakkan kaki\Ndi sini sejak insiden itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.31,0:02:02.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami sudah menanti Anda.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.21,0:02:10.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Tomonari telah tiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.95,0:02:14.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Narika, kau tidak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.52,0:02:16.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Narika?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.34,0:02:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Se-Senang bertemu dengan Anda.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.88,0:02:22.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya. Silakan masuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.89,0:02:29.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eum, Narika ada di mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.39,0:02:33.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kudengar, belakangan ini kau ikut campur\Nurusan pergaulan putriku.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.07,0:02:36.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku cuma ingin membantunya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.48,0:02:38.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Membantu, katamu?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.83,0:02:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eum, apa Anda tahu\Nsoal reputasi Narika di sekolah?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.00,0:02:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, kurang lebih.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.50,0:02:48.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Narika tak butuh perlindunganmu.\NDia tak selemah yang kau bayangkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.56,0:02:51.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak berniat mengguruinya\Ndengan kedok melindunginya.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.27,0:02:53.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baguslah kalau begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.67,0:02:56.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku masih ada kerjaan.\NPermisi dulu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.67,0:02:59.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Narika ada di dojo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.54,0:03:02.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu, jadi dia tidak sakit?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.99,0:03:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tu-Tunggu sebentar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.31,0:03:07.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.25,0:03:11.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maafkan kesalahanku yang membawa Narika\Npergi diam-diam waktu kami masih kecil.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.30,0:03:16.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Waktu itu Anda memarahiku,\Ntapi aku sama sekali belum minta maaf.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:19.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memarahimu? Padahal waktu itu\Naku sedang berterima kasih padamu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.50,0:03:21.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa? Seingatku waktu itu Anda bilang...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.03,0:03:24.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Beraninya kau menyeret putriku keluar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.19,0:03:28.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukankah Anda bilang begitu waktu itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.42,0:03:31.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dan setelahnya, aku menambahkan ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.41,0:03:34.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan memastikan kau\Nbersenang-senang sebagai balasannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.55,0:03:43.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa yang tak salah paham kalau\Nucapan itu dibarengi tampang seseram itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.23,0:03:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ingin membalas budi karena kau sudah\Nmengajak putriku bermain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.53,0:03:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi begitu, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.32,0:03:52.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tampaknya aku telah salah sangka.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.58,0:03:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maafkan aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.19,0:03:56.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cepat atau lambat kesalahpahaman\Npasti akan lurus dengan sendirinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.46,0:03:59.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Suatu saat nanti, orang-orang takkan lagi\Nsalah paham menilai Narika.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.86,0:04:04.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah itulah baru kemampuan aslinya\Nakan diuji.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.80,0:04:19.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Itsuki! Sedang apa kau di sini?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.10,0:04:21.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ke sini buat menjengukmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.82,0:04:24.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, jariku terkilir, nih.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.02,0:04:26.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terkilir?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.38,0:04:28.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa tak bakal ganggu penampilanmu\Nsaat turnamen nanti?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.36,0:04:31.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, tak jadi masalah, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.06,0:04:33.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jujur saja, niatnya hari ini\Naku mau tetap masuk,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.96,0:04:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi ayahku cerewet banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.66,0:04:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia paksa aku buat periksa ke dokter.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.02,0:04:39.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Protektif banget...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.64,0:04:41.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi sekarang aku paham!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.32,0:04:44.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau rela jauh-jauh ke sini\Nkarena mengkhawatirkanku, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.09,0:04:46.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah kau tak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.80,0:04:48.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf sudah ganggu latihanmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.43,0:04:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}K-Kau tak mengganggu, kok!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.36,0:04:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah lama banget sejak\Nterakhir kau main ke sini...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.52,0:04:53.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:55.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itsuki, kau masih ingat janji kita, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.93,0:05:00.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satu permintaan yang harus kau penuhi\Nkarena aku menang tanding tenis waktu itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.50,0:05:02.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-A-Aku ingin menagihnya sekarang!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.21,0:05:07.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}To-Tolong temani aku pergi ke suatu tempat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.93,0:05:11.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi tempat yang ingin kau kunjungi\Nadalah toko jajanan ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:13.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bikin kangen saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.20,0:05:14.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.45,0:05:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tempat ini kan markas kenangan kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.95,0:05:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa kau masih sering jajan di sini, Narika?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.70,0:05:22.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hampir tiap hari aku ke sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.74,0:05:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dulu kita selalu jajan di sini terus\Nmemakannya bareng-bareng di taman sebelah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.78,0:05:28.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena sudah lama juga, ayo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.80,0:05:32.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ingatan masa kecilmu ternyata tajam juga, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.92,0:05:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masa-masa itu sangat berjasa\Nmembentuk diriku yang sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.14,0:05:39.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan sikap legowoku\Nmenerima kekuranganku ini juga...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.41,0:05:41.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, kau pernah cerita soal itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.82,0:05:43.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Katanya ada orang yang mengajarimu hal itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.11,0:05:46.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi kau benar-benar sudah lupa.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.77,0:05:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang itu adalah kau, Itsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.18,0:05:50.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masa, sih?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.10,0:05:53.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dulu, waktu aku dimarahi\Nhabis-habisan sama Ayah,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.42,0:05:57.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kau bawa aku yang lagi nangis\Ntersedu-sedu ke sini terus menghiburku.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.00,0:05:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"Kau itu tangguh."
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.66,0:06:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"Kau jauh lebih tangguh dariku,\Nsampai-sampai aku iri."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.59,0:06:05.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Habis ngomong begitu, kau bilang...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.50,0:06:06.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itsuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.89,0:06:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kok kau bisa setangguh ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.47,0:06:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak setangguh itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.10,0:06:15.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aslinya aku ini gemetaran\Ntiap kali dibentak orang dewasa.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.94,0:06:18.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dulu aku juga ngeri banget\Nsama serangga dan petir.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.46,0:06:21.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benarkah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.09,0:06:25.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sadar betul betapa lemahnya diriku,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.52,0:06:27.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi kubiarkan rasa putus asa\Nmengambil alih semuanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.79,0:06:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kata-katamu itu membekas erat\Ndi lubuk hatiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.91,0:06:34.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:36.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Putus asa, katamu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.08,0:06:38.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dari dulu, sikapku masih sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.23,0:06:40.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Narika juga...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.27,0:06:42.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selama ini dia berjuang keras sendirian.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.31,0:06:47.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Momen istimewa semacam ini pastinya\Njadi milikku seorang, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.95,0:06:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentang hal apa itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.59,0:06:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudku, jalan-jalan cuma berduaan begini.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.20,0:06:57.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Konohana pernah bilang sih dia pernah pergi\Ndenganmu, tapi paling itu cuma gertakan saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.02,0:06:59.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apalagi Tennoji, keluarganya\Nkan ketat banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.53,0:07:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gertakan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.96,0:07:05.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Enggak kok, aku pernah jalan\Nsekali dengan mereka buat senang-senang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.05,0:07:06.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa? Ke-Ke mana?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.87,0:07:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ke tempat seperti arkade.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.29,0:07:10.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Arkade?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.46,0:07:12.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kok tak adil banget mereka berdua\Nboleh jalan bersamamu?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.41,0:07:14.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}K-Kau juga tak pernah\Ncerita apa-apa soal ini!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.62,0:07:17.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tak perlu sekompetitif itu\Nsoal hal receh begini.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.76,0:07:20.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu saja aku bakal kompetitif...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.19,0:07:23.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagian...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.72,0:07:27.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ini kan yang paling duluan\Nketemu denganmu, Itsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.14,0:07:31.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi entah kenapa, semua orang malah\Npada caper padamu...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.12,0:07:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa jangan-jangan kau cemburu?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.18,0:07:36.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.74,0:07:42.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ce-Cemburu?\NBu-Bu-Buat apa juga aku cemburu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.55,0:07:46.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Benar juga, ya.\NMaaf, aku ngomong hal yang ngawur.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.16,0:07:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan... Apa yang kau bilang itu benar...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.58,0:07:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.78,0:07:54.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Aku... sangat cemburu!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.95,0:07:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo jalan, Narika.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.55,0:08:03.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar kuantar kau ke arkade\Natau ke mana pun yang kau mau.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.33,0:08:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo kita pergi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.13,0:08:17.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lihat betapa ramainya kerumunan ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.22,0:08:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku berani taruhan\Nseparuhnya ini cuma pelayan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.06,0:08:23.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan wali murid?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.32,0:08:24.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.04,0:08:27.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mayoritas orang tua murid di sini\Nitu super sibuk.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.97,0:08:30.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa itu berarti Tuan Kagen juga tak datang?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:32.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku ke sini buat mewakili beliau.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.52,0:08:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shizune!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.03,0:08:37.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kukira kau langsung balik\Nsetelah mengantar kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.63,0:08:41.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Kagen memberiku tugas\Nuntuk merekam penampilan Nona.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.12,0:08:45.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong jangan lakukan itu, aku malu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.38,0:08:47.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Itsuki, mari kita adakan\Nnobar rekaman ini nanti.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.26,0:08:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hitung-hitung apresiasi buat Nona\Nyang sudah capek-capek diet.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.11,0:08:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Shi-Shizune!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.70,0:08:55.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, Tomonari! Konohana!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.45,0:08:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo kita ke lapangan\Nbuat nonton penampilan divisi dansa!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.30,0:09:04.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah penampilan mereka selesai,\Naku harus buru-buru pergi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.62,0:09:07.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soalnya arena ski-nya ada di luar akademi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.98,0:09:12.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga harus meluncur cepat ke arena polo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.25,0:09:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Acara ini dimulai sangat awal,\Njadi jadwalku padat sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.34,0:09:18.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berjuanglah sebaik mungkin, kalian berdua.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.22,0:09:19.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itsuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.04,0:09:22.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Narika, kau tak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.94,0:09:23.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku baik-baik saja, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.26,0:09:27.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tadi pagi, ada teman kelasku yang lain\Nyang menghampiriku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.62,0:09:30.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka bilang mau\Nmenyemangati pertandinganku nanti.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.40,0:09:32.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini semua berkat dukunganmu dan yang lainnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.70,0:09:34.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tak takut lagi sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:35.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.90,0:09:38.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Peserta divisi dansa\Nakan segera memasuki lapangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.96,0:09:41.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mari kita sambut mereka\Ndengan tepuk tangan yang meriah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.27,0:09:48.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.18,0:09:51.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Turnamen olahraga akhirnya dimulai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.66,0:09:56.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satu set pertandingan, Tomonari yang\Nmelakukan servis. Bersedia, mulai.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.42,0:09:57.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semoga beruntung.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.16,0:10:06.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hinako, pertandingannya sudah selesai?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.43,0:10:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya. Tentu saja menang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.00,0:10:11.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Juara bertahan tahun lalu memang beda\Nkualitasnya. Kemenangan yang gampang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.30,0:10:13.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kau bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.69,0:10:15.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untungnya aku berhasil menang...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.42,0:10:17.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua ini berkat didikan keras Narika.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.50,0:10:20.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya, sih. Aku juga terbantu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.06,0:10:20.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu sekarang bagaimana?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.18,0:10:23.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sambil nunggu giliran babak kedua,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.31,0:10:25.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}bagaimana kalau kita nonton\Ncabang olahraga lain?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.11,0:10:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setuju.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.17,0:10:30.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku penasaran mau lihat aksinya\NTennoji dan Taisho.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.86,0:10:32.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mari kita ke sana.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.99,0:10:37.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sambungan langsung!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.46,0:10:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lihatlah kekuatan Dahsyat Taisho!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.10,0:10:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukannya dia bilang kita dilarang ngebut\Ndi arena ski kering?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.52,0:10:48.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Suara itu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.19,0:10:56.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kelihatannya dia bersenang-senang.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.06,0:10:57.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia tampak bersinar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.04,0:11:02.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Narika...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.85,0:11:04.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sepertinya tidak ada di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.48,0:11:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia melibas semua lawannya dengan telak\Ndi pertandingan sebelumnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.51,0:11:09.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pasti dia sedang istirahat di suatu tempat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.18,0:11:12.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}E-Eum, Konohana!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.72,0:11:15.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa perlu kuusir mereka?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.40,0:11:17.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak usah. Biar aku saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.38,0:11:19.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Miyakojima juga lagi berjuang, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.77,0:11:22.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah kalau begitu. Sampai jumpa nanti.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.16,0:11:26.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertandingan tadi keren banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.93,0:11:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sampai dibuat merinding!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.00,0:11:30.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.89,0:11:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itsuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.92,0:11:38.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata kau sembunyi di sini, Narika?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.14,0:11:38.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.24,0:11:41.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku jalan-jalan keliling\Nselagi nunggu jadwal tanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.48,0:11:43.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimana jarimu yang terkilir?\NSudah baikan?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.00,0:11:45.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak apa-apa, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Malahan kondisiku lagi prima-primanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.00,0:11:51.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tahun lalu, aku cuma bisa meringkuk\Ndan tak berani keluyuran begini.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.04,0:11:53.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini semua berkatmu, Itsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.07,0:11:54.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan karenaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.73,0:11:56.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ini hasil usahamu sendiri\Nyang pantang menyerah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.73,0:11:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua orang juga menyadari itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.19,0:12:01.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanya, banggalah dengan usahamu dan...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.64,0:12:03.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, kau salah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.91,0:12:05.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau yang berjuang mati-matian buatku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.20,0:12:10.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski tak kulihat, kau sudah\Nberjuang keras buatku di balik layar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.95,0:12:14.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerja kerasmu itu\Nmulai membuahkan hasil sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.63,0:12:16.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau berjuang sangat keras.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.18,0:12:20.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Meski banyak rintangan menghadang,\Nkau tak pernah menyerah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.60,0:12:25.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Narika?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.83,0:12:27.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bu-Bukan apa-apa, kok.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.73,0:12:31.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}To-Tolong buang muka sebentar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.67,0:12:38.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}K-Kau selama ini galak padaku,\Ntapi sekarang kau malah memujiku begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.02,0:12:39.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau ini curang banget...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.59,0:12:42.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maafkan aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.38,0:12:50.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah mendingan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.04,0:12:50.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.99,0:12:53.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku harap seiring berjalannya waktu,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:56.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kau akan menemukan\Nlebih banyak lagi momen spesial untukmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:57.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Spesial?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.73,0:12:59.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Waktu itu,\Nkau bilang kehadiranku itu spesial untukmu,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:02.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan katanya cuma aku satu-satunya\Norang yang bisa kau ajak ngobrol sebebas ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.79,0:13:07.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kuharap kau bisa menemukan\Nlebih banyak lagi orang sepertiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.11,0:13:11.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baiklah, waktunya kembali.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.06,0:13:12.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.87,0:13:14.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa, Narika?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.42,0:13:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.90,0:13:18.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau salah...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.62,0:13:20.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau salah paham soal itu, Itsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.07,0:13:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semuanya melenceng jauh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.45,0:13:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berkat bantuanmu, aku jadi mulai luwes\Nbersosialisasi dengan orang banyak.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.95,0:13:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Konohana, Tennoji,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.63,0:13:33.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Taisho, dan Asahi...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.67,0:13:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan akhir-akhir ini aku juga ngobrol\Ndengan anak cowok kayak Kita.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.18,0:13:42.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi bagiku, kau itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.90,0:13:46.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}I-Itsuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.33,0:13:48.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagiku...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.15,0:13:50.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudku, bagiku...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.52,0:13:52.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau itu tak tergantikan, Itsuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.77,0:13:59.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekalipun di masa depan aku bakal menjalin\Nrelasi dengan berbagai macam orang...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.63,0:14:02.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satu-satunya yang bertakhta di hatiku\Ntetap kau, Itsuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.05,0:14:05.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma kau, satu-satunya untuk selamanya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.10,0:14:10.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itulah sebabnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.69,0:14:14.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Takkan ada seorang pun yang bisa\Nmenggeser posisimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.54,0:14:17.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kuharap kau ingat baik-baik perkataanku itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.47,0:14:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itsuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.81,0:14:27.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah? Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.45,0:14:30.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada yang mengganggu pikiranmu?\NKau melamun, tuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.27,0:14:32.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak ada apa-apa, kok...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.10,0:14:36.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah, tidak, sebenarnya baru saja\Nterjadi momen epik.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.29,0:14:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Epik?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.91,0:14:38.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Iya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.46,0:14:41.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sip!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.53,0:14:43.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Saatnya bakar semangat buat babak kedua.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.36,0:14:47.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nanti aku nyusul ke sana\Nkalau pertandinganku sudah beres, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.55,0:14:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya. Berjuanglah, Itsuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.15,0:15:00.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bakat menjilatmu masih belum luntur, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.35,0:15:02.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.26,0:15:08.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi penjilat andal sepertimu itu\Nbutuh keahlian khusus, lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.70,0:15:12.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berkat nyinyirannya,\Naku jadi sadar akan kelemahanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.32,0:15:15.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sangat berterima kasih padanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.02,0:15:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namun, perlakuan kurang ajarnya pada Narika\Nmasih tak bisa kumaafkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.38,0:15:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Satu set pertandingan,\NNada melakukan servis. Bersedia, mulai.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.28,0:15:27.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau adalah satu-satunya orang\Nyang pantang kukalahkan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.88,0:15:37.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertandingan selesai!\NDimenangkan oleh Tomonari!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.69,0:15:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kemenangan... yang sangat tipis.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.20,0:15:44.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Boleh tahan juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.07,0:15:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, terima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.50,0:15:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada yang ingin kutanyakan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.81,0:15:58.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada hubungan apa sebenarnya\Nantara kau dan Konohana?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.91,0:16:02.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan-jangan kau naksir Hinako, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.84,0:16:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengar-dengar keluargamu\Npunya koneksi dengan Grup Konohana,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.29,0:16:08.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi masih banyak keluarga lain\Nyang statusnya sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.75,0:16:11.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tampaknya cuma kau\Nyang bisa merebut hatinya.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.93,0:16:15.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong jaga rahasia ini rapat-rapat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.15,0:16:17.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Faktanya, aku ini kerja di rumah Konohana.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.01,0:16:21.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku disuruh orang tuaku\Nuntuk mengasah tata kramaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.65,0:16:23.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi begitu rupanya...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.16,0:16:27.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mau bagaimana lagi, kelihatannya Konohana\Nmemang mustahil untuk kudapatkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.87,0:16:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eum, apa mungkin...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.61,0:16:32.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar kuperjelas, Tomonari.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.83,0:16:35.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sampai kapan pun aku takkan sudi\Nberdamai denganmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.89,0:16:39.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sayang sekali ya, tapi ya sudah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.53,0:16:42.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tapi nanti aku bakal minta maaf\Nlangsung ke Miyakojima.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.06,0:16:50.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Langkahku terhenti di babak ketiga.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.36,0:16:55.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sedangkan Hinako melenggang bebas\Nmeraih trofi juara tunggal putri.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.59,0:16:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Capeknya...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.22,0:17:01.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bolehkah aku minta es krim sebagai imbalan?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.58,0:17:02.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tentu!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.80,0:17:10.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Permisi, ada keributan apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.08,0:17:10.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.66,0:17:14.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, ada kendala teknis pada sistem\Npendingin ruangan di tengah acara,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.98,0:17:17.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadinya jadwal pertandingan kendo\Nharus diundur.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.42,0:17:19.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pantas saja\Nbanyak orang berkumpul di sini...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.98,0:17:22.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Babak semifinal baru mau dimulai.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.07,0:17:29.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa Narika baik-baik saja?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.75,0:17:33.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kuharap dia tak demam panggung\Ndisorot banyak pasang mata...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.33,0:17:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Syukurlah,\Ndia kelihatan berkonsentrasi penuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.18,0:17:40.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mulai!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.31,0:17:48.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Auranya terasa lebih mendominasi dari\Nbiasanya saat dia menggenggam pedang bambu...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.52,0:17:50.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu yang namanya Miyakojima?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.02,0:17:53.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tampangnya seram sekali,\Npersis kayak di gosip-gosip.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.59,0:17:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gosipnya peserta kendo putri\Nmakin menyusut drastis
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.85,0:17:59.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}gara-gara Miyakojima terlalu jago.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.90,0:18:03.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memang benar.\NKatanya sih, dia itu sadis tak kenal ampun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.05,0:18:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertandingan selesai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.34,0:18:13.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ih, dia melototin kita!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.38,0:18:14.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Duh, ngeri banget...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.42,0:18:20.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa reaksi mereka...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.87,0:18:25.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau dibiarkan begini,\Nkejadian tahun lalu bakal terulang lagi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.86,0:18:28.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu, ada satu cara.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.68,0:18:30.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika dia mau mengalah di final...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.61,0:18:32.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Skenario itu di luar bayanganku.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.74,0:18:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Narika!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.23,0:18:38.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pura-pura kalah agar dirimu\Nterlihat tidak terlalu kuat...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.24,0:18:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Narika, itu kan cuma sekadar\Nopsi yang bisa kau pilih...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.10,0:18:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan masalah.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.48,0:18:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar aku yang bereskan semuanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.50,0:18:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mulai!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.84,0:18:59.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.31,0:19:04.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah? Kok Miyakojima...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.45,0:19:06.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gaya bertarungnya agak janggal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.82,0:19:09.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya taktik ini bakal berhasil.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.10,0:19:13.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Narika bakal kalah,\Ndan citra seramnya bakal sirna.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.87,0:19:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namun, apakah ini akhir yang kuinginkan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.75,0:19:20.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itsuki, apa yang ingin kau lakukan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.47,0:19:23.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.11,0:19:27.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Narika yang kukagumi itu\Norangnya pantang menyerah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.49,0:19:30.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Biar kata ceroboh dan cengeng,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.50,0:19:32.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}justru tekadnya untuk berubah lebih baiklah
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.96,0:19:34.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}yang jadi nilai jual utamanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.18,0:19:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.50,0:19:39.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mereka punya kesamaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:44.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hinako dan Tennoji sangat menyadari\Nkelemahan mereka,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.42,0:19:47.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi mereka tak henti\Nberjuang memperbaiki diri.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.84,0:19:51.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Makanya mereka bisa melangkah dengan pasti\Nsambil menebar senyum di wajah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.17,0:19:54.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hinako, aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.84,0:19:56.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kurasa kau tak perlu terlalu mencemaskannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.87,0:20:02.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekalipun kemenangan Miyakojima\Nmembuat suasana jadi canggung...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.44,0:20:04.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asalkan kau memberinya apresiasi yang tulus,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.63,0:20:07.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku yakin segalanya\Nakan berjalan sesuai dengan yang diharapkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.21,0:20:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maksudmu?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.94,0:20:10.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Singkatnya, Itsuki...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.83,0:20:13.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan ragu untuk\Nmengutarakan isi hatimu kepadanya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.50,0:20:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Narika!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.43,0:20:25.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berikan segenap kemampuanmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.42,0:20:33.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kote!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.97,0:20:37.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.57,0:20:40.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pertandingan selesai!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.69,0:21:01.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, pertarungan tadi sungguh epik.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.99,0:21:04.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, aku sampai dibikin takjub olehnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.86,0:21:07.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Miyakojima memang jagoan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.81,0:21:26.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nah, betul kan dugaanku?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.05,0:21:30.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Siapa lagi coba yang paling\Npaham dirimu selain aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.93,0:21:34.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, Hinako.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.36,0:21:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat pagi, Konohana.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.81,0:21:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat pagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.02,0:22:01.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}"Bunga yang tak tersentuh", ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.99,0:22:06.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa dibilang, akademi ini adalah taman\Nyang dipenuhi bunga beraneka ragam.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.82,0:22:08.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namun, meskipun demikian,\Nkelak suatu hari nanti...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.75,0:22:11.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat pagi, Tomonari.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.20,0:22:14.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat pagi, Tennoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.34,0:22:18.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tak sabar rasanya nunggu pesta teh hari ini\Nsetelah sekian lama.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.63,0:22:20.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.11,0:22:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itsuki!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.71,0:22:27.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pagi, Narika.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.15,0:22:28.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.10,0:22:29.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itsuki, tebak!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.76,0:22:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ternyata ada toko baru buka\Ndi sekitar komplekku!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.54,0:22:33.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Toko?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.53,0:22:34.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Toko apa itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.33,0:22:38.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Katanya toko kue yang lagi viral.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.38,0:22:40.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi pada ngomongin apa nih?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.06,0:22:41.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.15,0:22:43.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau saja dengar kelanjutan\Ncerita toko itu,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.74,0:22:46.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi kalian bisa telat masuk kelas.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.38,0:22:46.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.91,0:22:48.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.80,0:22:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Suatu hari nanti, aku akan...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.42,0:23:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}berdiri sejajar dengan semua orang...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.97,0:23:04.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sambil melangkah beriringan bersama mereka.
